                <pb facs="1222" n="1208" sameAs="frus:frus1944v01/pg1208"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.71114A/9–2544: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Harriman</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-09-30T16:00:00-04:00">September 30,
                            1944—4 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2327. Department has been informed by American Legation Bern<anchor n="68"
                        xml:id="d745-f1"/> that according to information received informally and
                    orally the only communication with Rumania is by telegraph in plain language.
                    Legation states that Swiss Foreign Office telegraphed to ascertain whether its
                    representative could continue protecting American interests until American
                    representatives could arrive and Minister’s reply was an inquiry as to when they
                    would reach there and that it is believed by Foreign Office that Swiss
                    representative will be unable to represent our interests and it strongly advises
                    that an American representative arrive at Bucharest very soon. The matter of
                    American representation in Rumania is being covered in a separate
                        telegram.<anchor n="69" xml:id="d745-f2"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
